# Uploaded and derived files. The gateway writes these under its own working
# directory, so the pattern has to match at any depth -- `data/uploads/` alone
# is anchored to the repository root and missed `apps/api-gateway/data/`.
**/data/uploads/
apps/api-gateway/data/

# Incremental TypeScript build state. Machine-specific, rewritten on every
# build, and a guaranteed merge conflict on every branch.
*.tsbuildinfo

